<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<p id="demoNarration" style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;color:#222">Three cases, one instrument — All three drawings are the same U-tube of mercury connected to a gas bulb; only the far arm and the liquid levels differ. Each configuration carries its own equation for P<sub>gas</sub>.</p>
